<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Photography Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap');

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html, body {
            width: 100%;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Reross Quadratic', 'Space Mono', monospace;
            background-color: #fafafa;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Typography */
        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
            font-family: 'Plakato Inline Pro', 'Space Mono', monospace;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
            padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #1a1a1a;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: #666;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            padding: 4rem;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        header.collapsed {
            padding: 1rem 4rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #d0d0d0;
        }

        .header-content {
            max-width: 1600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h1 {
            transition: font-size 0.3s ease;
        }

        header.collapsed h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .subtitle {
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease, max-height 0.3s ease;
            max-height: 100px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        header.collapsed .subtitle {
            opacity: 0;
            max-height: 0;
        }

        nav {
            transition: margin-top 0.3s ease, gap 0.3s ease;
        }

        header.collapsed nav {
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        /* Add space for fixed header */
        body {
            padding-top: 200px;
        }

        body.header-collapsed {
            padding-top: 80px;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        nav a {
            font-family: 'Reross Quadratic', 'Space Mono', monospace;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a1a;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
        }

        nav a.active {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a1a;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* Main Container */
        main {
            max-width: 1600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 4rem;
        }

        /* Section */
        section {
            margin-bottom: 8rem;
            scroll-margin-top: 150px;
        }

        section.hidden {
            display: none;
        }

        .section-intro {
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        .section-intro h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .section-intro p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /* Masonry Gallery */
        .gallery {
            column-count: 3;
            column-gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .gallery-item {
            break-inside: avoid;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }

        .gallery-item:hover {
            border-color: #1a1a1a;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }

        .gallery-item img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
        }

        /* Modal */
        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 1000;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
            animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; }
            to { opacity: 1; }
        }

        .modal.show {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .modal-content {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 90vw;
            max-height: 90vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .modal-image {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .modal-close {
            position: absolute;
            top: 2rem;
            right: 2rem;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .modal-close:hover {
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        .modal-nav {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 3rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
            padding: 2rem;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .modal-nav:hover {
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        .modal-prev {
            left: 0;
        }

        .modal-next {
            right: 0;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 4rem;
            margin-top: 6rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
        }

        footer p {
            max-width: 1600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .gallery {
                column-count: 2;
                column-gap: 1.5rem;
            }

            main {
                padding: 2rem;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 3rem;
            }

            h2 {
                font-size: 1.75rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .gallery {
                column-count: 1;
            }

            header {
                padding: 2rem;
            }

            nav {
                gap: 0.75rem;
            }

            nav a {
                font-size: 0.8rem;
                padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            h2 {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }

            .modal-nav {
                font-size: 2rem;
                padding: 1rem;
            }

            .modal-close {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="header-content">
            <h1>PHOTOGRAPHY</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">A Visual Collection</p>
            <nav id="nav-menu">
                <a class="nav-link active" data-section="all-work">All Work</a>
                <a class="nav-link" data-section="icons-skylines">Icons & Skylines</a>
                <a class="nav-link" data-section="urban-life">Urban Life</a>
                <a class="nav-link" data-section="movement">Movement</a>
                <a class="nav-link" data-section="structures">Structures</a>
                <a class="nav-link" data-section="landscapes">Landscapes</a>
                <a class="nav-link" data-section="quiet-moments">Quiet Moments</a>
                <a class="nav-link" data-section="culture-rituals">Culture & Rituals</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- All Work -->
        <section id="all-work" class="collection-section">
            <div class="section-intro">
                <h2>All Work</h2>
                <p>A curated selection from across the full collection, showcasing the breadth of visual exploration and the interconnected nature of seeing.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery" id="gallery-all"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- Icons & Skylines -->
        <section id="icons-skylines" class="collection-section hidden">
            <div class="section-intro">
                <h2>Icons & Skylines</h2>
                <p>Urban geometry and iconic architecture captured against the sky. A study of the visual language of the built environment and human ambition.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery" id="gallery-icons-skylines"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- Urban Life -->
        <section id="urban-life" class="collection-section hidden">
            <div class="section-intro">
                <h2>Urban Life</h2>
                <p>The rhythm and texture of city living. Street photography documenting human presence, interaction, and the spontaneous moments that define urban experience.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery" id="gallery-urban-life"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- Movement -->
        <section id="movement" class="collection-section hidden">
            <div class="section-intro">
                <h2>Movement</h2>
                <p>Capturing motion and energy. A study of human kinetics, sport, and the fleeting moments when stillness breaks into action.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery" id="gallery-movement"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- Structures -->
        <section id="structures" class="collection-section hidden">
            <div class="section-intro">
                <h2>Structures</h2>
                <p>Architectural and structural studies. Form, line, and composition in the built world—exploring how design shapes space and human perception.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery" id="gallery-structures"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- Landscapes -->
        <section id="landscapes" class="collection-section hidden">
            <div class="section-intro">
                <h2>Landscapes</h2>
                <p>Natural environments and expansive views. The interplay of light, shadow, and natural form—documenting the sublime and the subtle.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery" id="gallery-landscapes"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- Quiet Moments -->
        <section id="quiet-moments" class="collection-section hidden">
            <div class="section-intro">
                <h2>Quiet Moments</h2>
                <p>Intimate observations and subtle details. Photography that invites contemplation—finding meaning in stillness and the quiet spaces of life.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery" id="gallery-06.-quiet-moments"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- Culture & Rituals -->
        <section id="culture-rituals" class="collection-section hidden">
            <div class="section-intro">
                <h2>Culture & Rituals</h2>
                <p>Explorations of cultural practices, traditions, and rituals. Documenting the human experiences that define communities and mark moments of significance.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery" id="gallery-tbd-culture-rituals"></div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Photography Portfolio. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

    <!-- Modal for full-size image view -->
    <div id="imageModal" class="modal">
        <span class="modal-close">&times;</span>
        <span class="modal-nav modal-prev">&lt;</span>
        <div class="modal-content">
            <img class="modal-image" src="" alt="">
        </div>
        <span class="modal-nav modal-next">&gt;</span>
    </div>

